/**
 * Puzzle Journey art registry: art name -> bundled module id.
 *
 * Metro can only resolve literal `require` calls at build time, so this map
 * cannot be built by globbing at runtime. It mirrors `puzzle-assets.ts`.
 *
 * Requiring the @1x path is deliberate — Metro reads the sibling `@2x`/`@3x`
 * files and serves the right density per device.
 *
 * GENERATED by scripts/build-art.mjs's sibling generator, but committed and
 * safe to hand-edit. Adding an asset means dropping the SVG in
 * `assets/art-source/`, re-running `node scripts/build-art.mjs`, and adding
 * one line here.
 */

